        {
          "question": "Is the free plan really free?",
          "answer": "Yes. It covers 50 receipts a month for a single user, with 5-file batches and CSV export. Paid plans add volume, team tools and deeper reporting — not a different reading model."
        },
        {
          "question": "How does annual billing work?",
          "answer": "Annual billing charges once for twelve months. Pro is RM 108 a year instead of RM 120, and Max is RM 216 instead of RM 240 — 10% off either way."
        },
        {
          "question": "What counts as a receipt?",
          "answer": "One uploaded scan or emailed receipt counts once, however many line items it contains. Max removes the monthly cap."
        },
        {
          "question": "Can I change plans later?",
          "answer": "Yes. Plan and billing-period changes live in subscription settings, so you can move from monthly to annual without starting over."
        },
        {
          "question": "What is on every plan?",
          "answer": "Line-item extraction, confidence scoring, multi-currency detection, SST capture and CSV export. The reading is the same; the limits and team controls are not."
        }
